+# Activities
+
+Activities are the account timeline: a record of what happened to cards and
+comments, such as publishing, moving, renaming, assigning, closing, and
+commenting. Activities mirror the events shown in the HTML timeline.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated, flat list of activity the current user can access, newest
+first. Activity on boards the user cannot access is never returned.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by the user ID(s) who performed the activity |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+Only activity the current user can access is returned, so board filters are
+intersected with the boards the user can access.
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+    "action": "card_assigned",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.540Z",
+    "description": "David Heinemeier Hansson assigned JZ to \"First!\"",
+    "particulars": {
+      "assignee_ids": [
+        "03f5v9zk1dtqduod5bkhv3k8m"
+      ]
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+      "number": 4,
+      "title": "First!",
+      "status": "published",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "creator": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+        "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+        "role": "owner",
+        "active": true,
+        "email_address": "david@example.com",
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+      }
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  },
+  {
+    "id": "03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz",
+    "action": "comment_created",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+    "description": "David Heinemeier Hansson commented on \"First!\"",
+    "particulars": {},
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4#comment_03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz",
+    "eventable_type": "Comment",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+      "updated_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+      "body": {
+        "plain_text": "This looks great!",
+        "html": "<div class=\"action-text-content\">This looks great!</div>"
+      },
+      "card": {
+        "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4"
+      },
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4/comments/03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "creator": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+        "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+        "role": "owner",
+        "active": true,
+        "email_address": "david@example.com",
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+      }
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+`eventable` uses the representation of the underlying resource: a card for card
+events, or a comment for comment events. `board` and `creator` use the board and
+user representations. The nested card and comment objects are abbreviated in the
+example above; they match the Cards and Comments endpoints.
+
+For card events, `url` opens the card. For comment events, `url` opens the card
+where the comment was posted and jumps to that comment.
+
+### Particulars
+
+The `particulars` object contains event-specific details:
+
+| Action | Particulars |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids` |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board`, `new_board` |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title`, `new_title` |
+| `card_triaged`, `card_sent_back_to_triage` | `column` |
+
+Other actions return an empty `particulars` object. Missing board, title, or
+column values are returned as empty strings.
+
+### Actions
+
+The timeline includes the following actions: `card_assigned`,
+`card_unassigned`, `card_published`, `card_closed`, `card_reopened`,
+`card_board_changed`, `card_postponed`, `card_auto_postponed`, `card_triaged`,
+`card_sent_back_to_triage`, `card_title_changed`, and `comment_created`.
+
+The deprecated `card_collection_changed` action is omitted.
